# Immutable output contract
The initializer produced this immutable projection of the user request.
The original user request is authoritative if this projection omits or conflicts with it.
Preserve its explicitly requested filenames, shapes, counts, scope, and evidence requirements.
```json
{
  "outputs": [
    {
      "id": "cold_outreach_csv",
      "kind": "table",
      "filename": "cold_outreach.csv",
      "format": "csv",
      "columns": [
        {
          "name": "founder_name",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "linkedin_url",
          "required": true,
          "type": "url"
        },
        {
          "name": "cold_outreach_email",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "minimum_row_count",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "unique",
          "columns": [
            "founder_name",
            "linkedin_url"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "contentExpectations": [
    "Select exactly 5 AI-focused companies from the YC Winter 2024 (W24) batch.",
    "Include one row for every founder of each of the 5 selected companies (all co-founders represented, not just one per company).",
    "Each cold_outreach_email must be personalized to the specific founder and their specific company, referencing details relevant to that founder/company.",
    "Each cold_outreach_email must explicitly request a 15-minute call.",
    "linkedin_url should be the founder's individual LinkedIn profile URL."
  ]
}
```

